        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 4 - Key Decisions\nKey Decisions\nRole\nDetermine Level C staff members eligible to apply for a Dean appointment\nVice-Chancellor\nApprove the appointment of the Dean\nVice-Chancellor\nApprove the early termination of a Dean appointment\nVice-Chancellor"
    },
    {
