        "paragraph_start": 4,
        "paragraph_end": 4,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Appointments\n(4)\nThe Provost will recommend to the Vice-Chancellor that the position for Dean is advertised both internally and externally."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-7",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Responsibility",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 5,
        "paragraph_end": 6,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Responsibility\n(5)\nThe Provost is responsible for the appointment process of Deans.\n(6)\nThe Provost and/or Vice-Chancellor has authority to approve the appointment of the Dean position."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-8",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Eligibility",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 7,
        "paragraph_end": 8,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Eligibility\n(7)\nStaff members at Level D or above are eligible to express an interest in the position of Dean.\n(8)\nHowever, on recommendation of the Provost\n, the Vice-Chancellor may determine that staff members at Level C are eligible to apply."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-9",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Terms of Appointment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 9,
        "paragraph_end": 9,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Terms of Appointment\n(9)\nThe Dean appointment will be a fixed term contract (up to a maximum of five (5) years) and may combine a substantive academic position for internal applicants only."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-10",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Advertising a Position",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 10,
        "paragraph_end": 10,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Advertising a Position\n(10)\nTo advertise the Dean position, a Job Card must be raised through Page Up, the position can be advertised both internally and externally."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-11",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Application",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 11,
        "paragraph_end": 11,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Application\n(11)\nTo apply for the position, candidates are required to:\nsubmit an application following the instructions provided in the advertisement; and\naddress any requirements that are specified as part of the application process for that position."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-12",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Selection Process",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 12,
        "paragraph_end": 13,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Selection Process\n(12)\nThe Dean Selection Committee will make a selection based on merit by conducting a thorough recruitment process.\n(13)\nThe Dean Selection Committee will comprise::\nProvost\n(Chair);\nVice-Chancellor (optional)\nDeputy Vice-Chancellor (Research and Innovation) or representative;\nDeputy Vice-Chancellor (Academic) or representative;\nDean of another school;\nExternal member/expert/CPO or delegate (nominated by the Provost) - (optional)\nProfessor within the school (optional); and/or\nSenior staff member (optional)."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-13",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Assessment of Suitable Candidates",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 14,
        "paragraph_end": 14,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Assessment of Suitable Candidates\n(14)\nThe Dean Selection Committee will review the submitted applications, , conduct interviews, and other suitable assessments such as a requesting a presentation be provided etc. to assess for suitability against the requirements of the position based on merit."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-14",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Finalising an Appointment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 15,
        "paragraph_end": 17,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Finalising an Appointment\n(15)\nThe\nProvost\nwill forward a recommendation for appointment to the Vice-Chancellor for endorsement through Page Up. Confirmation via electronic sign-off will enable contract generation.\n(16)\nThe Chair will make the verbal offer to the successful candidate and, upon verbal acceptance from the candidate, notify the Talent Acquisition team with the outcome to generate the offer card in PageUp.\n(17)\nA contract will be sent to the successful candidate for acceptance electronically."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-15",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Termination of Appointment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 18,
        "paragraph_end": 22,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=57",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=57",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Termination of Appointment\n(18)\nThe Dean contract will end at the date outlined in the contract of employment, unless terminated earlier.\n(19)\nThe\nProvost\nin consultation with the Chief People Officer may recommend the early termination of the secondment of the Dean position to the Vice-Chancellor.\n(20)\nThe Vice-Chancellor has final authority to approve the early termination of the Dean contract. The incumbent may then revert to their substantive academic position (if applicable).\n(21)\nIf the staff member completes their term in the Dean position, at the end of the appointment period and if no extension offered, a Continuing position may be offered if the incumbent does not hold a substantive position.\n(22)\nIf the staff member does not complete their term in the Dean position, and they do not have a Continuing substantive position, then their appointment may be terminated. The staff member will not be offered a Continuing position in these circumstances."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "57-16",
        "document_id": "57",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure - Dean",
        "heading_level": "h1",
        "section": "Section 7 - Definitions",
        "subsection": null,
