        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 7 - Definitions\n(23)\nFor the purpose of this Procedure:\nJob Card: is the process in PageUp where hiring managers provide details of a position and recruitment requirements.\nPageUp: is the University’s e-recruitment system."
    },
